{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "278de63c-b9e0-4ca2-af56-7d1fb54f7a04",
    "name": "ACMS - Part E Offerings and enrolment",
    "description": "Run in order with the ACMS-Local environment. Needs: the registrar, field officer and farmer accounts from the main collection's Setup; the Field Officer (officerUserId) and the farmer's cooperative must both be in ownDistrictId. Every run creates its own season, programme and offering, so it can be run again. Since Step 6 the farmer must have paid at least 30%: E08a-E08d record and confirm a full payment first (needs financeUsername/financePassword and ownFarmerId).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
